#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"Averages the most recent numeric values of a range (simple moving average)."
msgstr ""
"Bildet den Mittelwert der letzten numerischen Werte eines Bereichs "
"(einfacher gleitender Durchschnitt)."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"How many of the last values to average, e.g. 3. A window larger than the "
"number of values averages all of them."
msgstr ""
"Wie viele der letzten Werte gemittelt werden, z. B. 3. Ein Fenster, das "
"größer als die Anzahl der Werte ist, mittelt alle Werte."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"Predicts the y value at a given x from a least-squares linear regression of "
"known data."
msgstr ""
"Sagt den y-Wert für ein gegebenes x anhand einer linearen Regression "
"(Methode der kleinsten Quadrate) bekannter Daten voraus."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"Returns the value of the least-squares trend line at a new x. When all "
"known_x values are identical, returns the average of known_y."
msgstr ""
"Gibt den Wert der Trendlinie (Methode der kleinsten Quadrate) an einem neuen"
" x zurück. Sind alle known_x-Werte identisch, wird der Mittelwert von "
"known_y zurückgegeben."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid "The known values, e.g. past sales."
msgstr "Die bekannten Werte, z. B. vergangene Umsätze."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid "The values to average. Blank and non-numeric cells are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Die Werte, deren Mittelwert gebildet wird. Leere und nicht numerische Zellen"
" werden übersprungen."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid "The x value to evaluate the trend line at."
msgstr "Der x-Wert, an dem die Trendlinie ausgewertet wird."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid "The x value to predict y for, e.g. the next month number."
msgstr ""
"Der x-Wert, für den y vorhergesagt wird, z. B. die Nummer des nächsten "
"Monats."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid "The x values paired row by row with known_y, e.g. the month numbers."
msgstr ""
"Die x-Werte, die zeilenweise zu known_y gehören, z. B. die Monatsnummern."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]] cannot fit a trend line because all known_x values are "
"identical. Use at least two different x values."
msgstr ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]] kann keine Trendlinie berechnen, weil alle known_x-Werte "
"identisch sind. Verwenden Sie mindestens zwei verschiedene x-Werte."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid "[[FUNCTION_NAME]] expects a window of at least 1, but got %s."
msgstr ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]] erwartet ein Fenster von mindestens 1, erhielt aber %s."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]] needs at least 2 rows where both known_x and known_y are "
"numbers. Blank and non-numeric cells are skipped."
msgstr ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]] benötigt mindestens 2 Zeilen, in denen sowohl known_x als "
"auch known_y Zahlen sind. Leere und nicht numerische Zellen werden "
"übersprungen."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]] needs at least one numeric value in the range. Blank and "
"non-numeric cells are skipped."
msgstr ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]] benötigt mindestens einen numerischen Wert im Bereich. "
"Leere und nicht numerische Zellen werden übersprungen."

#. module: spreadsheet_forecast_oca
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet_forecast_oca/static/src/spreadsheet/bundle/forecast_functions.esm.js:0
msgid ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]]: known_x has %(x_count)s cells but known_y has "
"%(y_count)s. Select two ranges of the same size so every x value is paired "
"with its y value."
msgstr ""
"[[FUNCTION_NAME]]: known_x hat %(x_count)s Zellen, known_y aber %(y_count)s."
" Wählen Sie zwei gleich große Bereiche, damit jeder x-Wert seinem y-Wert "
"zugeordnet ist."
